  const {stdout} = await promisify(execFile)('ls', ['-lh', '/usr']);
  ```
  It's _spawn_ that I care about, because that's the only asynchronous version of the API that supports `stdio: 'inherit'`. Today, If I want `stdio: inherit`, I have to go fiddling around with spawn callbacks.

